# Title: Security Software Discovery - Linux
# ID: c9d8b7fd-78e4-44fe-88f6-599135d46d60
# Status: test
# Level: low
# Author: Daniil Yugoslavskiy, oscd.community
# Date: 2020-10-19
# Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1518.001
# Description: Detects usage of system utilities (only grep and egrep for now) to discover security software discovery
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((process.executable:*/grep OR process.executable:*/egrep) AND (process.command_line:*nessusd* OR process.command_line:*td-agent* OR process.command_line:*packetbeat* OR process.command_line:*filebeat* OR process.command_line:*auditbeat* OR process.command_line:*osqueryd* OR process.command_line:*cbagentd* OR process.command_line:*falcond*))
